title = Akita
description = The Akita Inu (秋田犬, Akita inu, Akitaken; Japanese pronunciation: [ä̀.kʲi̥.tä́ ì.nɨ̀, -í.nɨ́, -ké̞ɴ́]) is a Japanese dog breed of large size. Originating from the mountains of northern Japan, the Akita has a short double coat similar to that of many other northern spitz breeds.
